WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.330
Evening in a Hindu temple.

2
00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:07.170
A tray of small flames moves in
slow circles before the shrine.

3
00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:08.340
Bells ring.

4
00:00:08.390 --> 00:00:09.800
People sing.

5
00:00:09.850 --> 00:00:13.210
Earlier, fruit and sweets
were offered to God.

6
00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:16.700
Now they are handed back,
and shared out to everyone.

7
00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:20.500
Why offer food to God, and
then take it back to eat?

8
00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:24.260
In this mission, you'll explore
many forms of Hindu worship,

9
00:00:24.310 --> 00:00:27.910
from fire offerings to
the sacred sound Om.

10
00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:33.240
Then you'll compare how devotees of
Vishnu and devotees of Shiva worship.

11
00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:36.890
Your mission: find out
why Hindus offer food,

12
00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:40.280
light and song to God,
then share the food.
